    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis:</h2><strong>The world is filled with curses that can corrode the World Tree and at the same time nurture it and all living things. There are ten major races living in the world created by the gods. The protagonist, Carrol, lives in the distant and luminous forest, away from the mundane world. She has just inherited the title of Duke from her deceased father and is preparing to inspect her territory when she meets a elf girl who has descended from the sky... As a vampire who has lived to the present, with a strong self-esteem and memories in her heart, what kind of things will Carrol encounter in the future...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2>The Curse Accumulation System and the Binding of the Lamb God will affect the difficulty of some battles and the direction of the plot. The personality-rich side-scrolling battle module and skill performances add to the experience, and there are six difficulty levels to accommodate different players' needs. There are over 15 playable characters, each with their own unique skill animations. The game also features rich maps and a compelling storyline, with both normal and hidden endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game time\uff1a</h2>8hours and more<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Role introduction:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/e297ec6df829a30a5ed6e08c5872a8a3.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Carrol, a vampire girl, inherited the title of the former lord.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/9712c39f825c50ead18692d9fdeca35f.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Leimi, an elf girl who descended from the sky.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/aec8bc50fa71f58152049ff2c3b43556.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Belia, a former monster hunter who appears in various places.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/f05604dcabe5bcad42a67a0651b7f8d9.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Kris, a girl who calls herself a novice adventurer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/81362bda02e6ca1be4398cc2c3b5bf56.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Bamanta, a warrior of the red dragon clan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429380/extras/86af06854a051fb87ef3c694bdb32b93.avif?t=1726294234\" /></span><br>Ashes\uff0c\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f<br><br>Welcome to visit my promotional website,the patches required for this operation can be downloaded from this website..<br>We are looking for the cooperation of game publishers or translators, if there is a transaction request, please contact my email.",
